       "code": "#include <stdio.h>\nvoid fibonacci1(int n) {\n  int arr[n];\n  arr[0] = arr[1] = 1;\n  for(int i = 2; i < n; i++) {\n    arr[i] = arr[i-1] + arr[i-2];\n  }\n  //输出结果 for(int i = 0; i < n; i++) printf(\"%d \", arr[i]);\n}\n12 void fibonacci2(int n) {\n  int first = 1, second = 1, next;\n  for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    if (i <= 1) next = 1;\n    18 else {\n      //三滚筒法输出 next = first + second;\n      first = second;\n      second = next;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d \", next);\n  }\n}\n27 int fibonacci3(int n) {\n  //递归求第n项斐波那契 if(n == 1 || n == 2) return 1;\n  else return fibonacci3(n - 2) + fibonacci3(n - 1);\n}\n35 int main() {\n  int n;\n  scanf(\"%d\", &n);\n  fibonacci3(n);\n  return 0;\n}\nNo. 14 / 19",
